{
    "background_story": "Shmoops, a slow-moving tortoise, lived a life of quiet determination. He resided in a small pond surrounded by lush greenery, where he spent his days basking in the warm sun and taking leisurely strolls. Despite his slow pace, Shmoops had a strong sense of justice and would not hesitate to stand up for his fellow pond creatures. One day, a group of mischievous raccoons began to pollute the pond, threatening the delicate ecosystem. Shmoops, undaunted by his slow speed, took it upon himself to confront the raccoons and put an end to their destructive ways. Through his persistence and refusal to back down, Shmoops successfully defended his home and earned the respect of his fellow animals. From then on, he was known as the heroic tort who fought for what was right, even if it meant taking his time to get there.",
